  },
  data: {
    LLM: "Play counter-clockwise. Must play exactly one card per turn. Three possible uses: Capture (captura/cojer) - take matching card(s) or builds; Build (forma) - combine with table cards into single build (sum=value) or multiple build (sets with same value); Trail - leave card on table. Restrictions: Build owner must hold matching card; Build owner cannot trail (must capture or build more); Cannot trail if played card matches any loose table card (must capture or build); Can capture builds only by matching value; Can increase single build value by adding card (become new owner). Cannot build for partner in partnership game. Cards left capturable called 'dejado' (left) or 'pisado' (stepped). Sweep: clear all table cards (scores bonus).",
    Player: "Play counter-clockwise. Must play exactly one card per turn. Three possible uses: Capture (captura/cojer) - take matching card(s) or builds; Build (forma) - combine with table cards into single build (sum=value) or multiple build (sets with same value); Trail - leave card on table. Restrictions: Build owner must hold matching card; Build owner cannot trail (must capture or build more); Cannot trail if played card matches any loose table card (must capture or build); Can capture builds only by matching value; Can increase single build value by adding card (become new owner). Cannot build for partner in partnership game. Cards left capturable called 'dejado' (left) or 'pisado' (stepped). Sweep: clear all table cards (scores bonus).",
    objective: 'Capture cards from table layout. First player/team to reach 21 points wins, with special endgame rules.',
    gameplay: "Play counter-clockwise. Must play exactly one card per turn. Three possible uses: Capture (captura/cojer) - take matching card(s) or builds; Build (forma) - combine with table cards into single build (sum=value) or multiple build (sets with same value); Trail - leave card on table. Restrictions: Build owner must hold matching card; Build owner cannot trail (must capture or build more); Cannot trail if played card matches any loose table card (must capture or build); Can capture builds only by matching value; Can increase single build value by adding card (become new owner). Cannot build for partner in partnership game. Cards left capturable called 'dejado' (left) or 'pisado' (stepped). Sweep: clear all table cards (scores bonus).",
    keyRules: [
      'Counter-clockwise play and deal',
